              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "धमाके से खिड़कियाँ थर्रा गईं। dhamāke se khiṛkiyā̃ tharrā gaīṁ. The windows shook with the blast."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (it …): वह दीवार थर्रा गई, vah dīvār tharrā gaī."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "थर्राना (tharrānā) is inherited from thar, a form CDIAL reconstructs for trembling (CDIAL 6092). It is a hard shaking, of a building or of a person in fear."
            }
          ]
        },
