          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "सदमा (sadmā) is usually traced, through Persian, to Arabic ṣadma, \"a blow, a collision\": a blow to the mind. A shock लगता है: मीरा को सदमा लगा."
            }
          ]
        },
